-recorded', timeoutHandling: 'not-recorded', renderThresholdOverride: 'not-recorded', sideEffectsBeyondReturn: 'not-recorded' },\n+  dsh:      { inputFieldNames: 'not-recorded', cwdResolution: 'not-recorded', inputSource: 'not-recorded', outputShape: 'not-recorded', timeoutHandling: 'not-recorded', renderThresholdOverride: 'not-recorded', sideEffectsBeyondReturn: 'not-recorded' },\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"diff --git a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts\nindex dad2d44b04..4dea40e98c 100644\n--- a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts\n+++ b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts\n@@ -4,5 +4,8 @@\n-// Invokes the brief renderer per runtime (claude/opencode),\n-// loads the iter-4 7-axis adapter divergence matrix as a fixture, and\n-// asserts non-zero signal counts per runtime. Collector-shape coverage for\n-// spec_kit.advisor.recommendation_emitted_total is kept separate from the\n-// renderer signal/noise boundary so metric emission is not confused with render behavior.\n+// Invokes the brief renderer per runtime. The iter-4 7-axis adapter divergence\n+// matrix was measured for Claude and OpenCode only, so every other runtime reads\n+// `not-recorded` on each axis. An invented axis reading would pass for a measured\n+// one, so a runtime nobody probed carries `not-recorded` rather than a guess.\n+// Loads the matrix as a fixture and asserts non-zero signal counts per runtime.\n+// Collector-shape coverage for spec_kit.advisor.recommendation_emitted_total is\n+// kept separate from the renderer signal/noise boundary so metric emission is not\n+// confused with render behavior.\n@@ -27,2 +30,7 @@ const SEVEN_AXIS_MATRIX: Record<typeof ADVISOR_RU